  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Banking &amp; Financial Services - Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An intermittent advisor has been working with the Superintendent of Banks (SIB) since the beginning of 2016 on the development/improvement of the deposit insurance system and resolution framework. Most recently, the advisor has worked on the implementation of recovery and resolution planning as well as the drafting of a legal framework for DIS and SRR. An analysis on compliance with best practices was facilitated to assist the authorities in identifying reforms needed to the DIS and resolution frameworks. A draft bill was submitted and is undergoing discussion with a designated reform team. New assistance is being provided in the areas of risk based supervision and financial stability.</narrative>
  </description>
